WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.378 --> 00:00:03.903
-The Texas heartbeat bill
has become law,

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:07.573
and now it is illegal to get an
abortion at 6 weeks or later.

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:09.609
Here to talk about it
is Amber Ruffin,

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.277
with "Amber's Minute of Fury."

00:00:12.277 --> 00:00:14.280
[ Heavy guitars playing ]

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.882
♪♪

00:00:16.882 --> 00:00:18.684
-Every politician in Texas

00:00:18.684 --> 00:00:21.420
wants to be in charge
of my body so bad.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.890
Well, if you gonna be
in charge of my body,

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.291
really do it then.

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:28.794
Be in charge of my whole body,
'fro to toes.

00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:30.396
Make it all your problem.

00:00:30.396 --> 00:00:33.466
I'm lactose intolerant
and I love ice cream,

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:35.601
so every time I want to
have Dairy Queen,

00:00:35.601 --> 00:00:36.669
tackle me.

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:38.337
And you better be strong, too,

00:00:38.337 --> 00:00:40.440
because I love
a Peanut Buster Parfait.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.610
Tell four-margaritas-in Amber
that she can't have a fifth.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:47.013
Try and reason with her.
I dare you!

00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.381
If you want to be in charge,
be in charge.

00:00:49.381 --> 00:00:51.083
Manage my calorie intake.

00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:52.685
Throw out my candy.

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:55.889
Good luck finding the candy
I have hidden from my husband.

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.123
He can't find it,
and he knows me.

00:00:58.123 --> 00:01:00.059
And if have the poops --
[Snaps] --

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:01.460
that's on you.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:03.763
You should have made sure
I didn't eat that food

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.032
I knew damn well was too old.

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:09.268
How are you just gonna be in
charge of one part of my body?

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:10.903
What kind of sense
does that make?

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:13.205
Be in charge of
my nappy head of hair.

00:01:13.205 --> 00:01:15.574
Find my curl pattern.

00:01:15.574 --> 00:01:19.678
Talk me into or out of
getting dreads every 6 months.

00:01:19.678 --> 00:01:21.981
I honestly don't know
what to do.

00:01:21.981 --> 00:01:23.783
Should I? I can't.

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:25.819
I should. I can't.

00:01:25.819 --> 00:01:28.387
And find my goddamn bonnet!

00:01:28.387 --> 00:01:31.791
All I'm saying is, if you're in
charge of one region of my body,

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:33.693
what sense does that make?

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:35.195
Just the uterus?

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:37.229
At least take
the whole bottom half.

00:01:37.229 --> 00:01:39.999
I want a federally-funded
pedicure.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:43.102
You can even pick the color.
I can never decide anyway.

00:01:43.102 --> 00:01:44.537
Should it be a French pedicure?

00:01:44.537 --> 00:01:45.538
I can't.

00:01:45.538 --> 00:01:47.773
I should. I can't.

00:01:47.773 --> 00:01:50.209
So just make them so
I can wear sandals

00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:51.377
without feeling sad.

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:52.545
Can you do that?

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:55.081
Of course you can't,
you dumb [bleep],

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:58.017
so don't take charge of
the biggest decision

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.551
I'll ever make in my whole life

00:01:59.551 --> 00:02:02.855
when you can't even get me
a goddamn pedicure!

00:02:02.855 --> 00:02:05.457
This has been
Amber's Minute of Fury!

00:02:05.457 --> 00:02:09.562
[ Heavy guitars playing ]

